  displayName: Devil
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 79718064e4b9ce647a6cc689eb1cf256, type: 3}
  description: Devils are disciplined demons of medium size, often armored or sharply
    dressed, with barbed tails and a pair of imposing wings folded neatly behind
    them. They move with controlled, purposeful steps, taking flight when it suits
    them but not fidgeting like imps. Their voices are clear, commanding speech,
    used for contracts, orders, and chillingly polite threats.
